# Nexa — Docker build context excludes (tm 140.1).
#
# Multi-stage builds (apps/api, apps/rtm, …) need the *whole* pnpm workspace
# in the build context — `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` validates every
# member listed in pnpm-workspace.yaml against pnpm-lock.yaml, so no
# apps/* or packages/* source tree can be dropped here. Only build output,
# dependency caches and local/dev-only artifacts are excluded.

# --- Dependencies / build output (reinstalled + rebuilt inside the image) ---
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.vite/
**/coverage/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.turbo/
**/.cache/
**/.eslintcache

# --- Secrets / env (never enter an image layer) ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- VCS / editor / OS ---
.git/
.gitignore
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
*.log

# --- Mobile (Expo) — irrelevant to api/rtm/web/widget images ---
apps/mobile/.expo/
apps/mobile/ios/
apps/mobile/android/

# --- Test / e2e artefacts ---
playwright-report/
test-results/
.playwright-mcp/
apps/e2e/

# --- Autonomous loop / Task Master local state ---
.loop-logs/
.taskmaster/**/*.log
.taskmaster/reports/
.taskmaster/config.local.json
.taskmaster/tmp-*

# --- Local dev runtime data ---
.data/

# --- Reference docs / images (large, not needed to build or run) ---
v2-derin-analiz/
gorseller/
images/
*.md
!README.md
